/-!
# C3h189: exact P506/L0 Lorentz canonical actual first-jet lift

This module specializes the generic C3h189 actualizer to the exact C3h187
generated current.  Its identity coframe is already generated by the prior
P506/L0 action path, so the canonical 18-coordinate BF Legendre section needs
no extra premise, normalization, response witness, branch, or coefficient.

For every contact and local Cauchy time, the same actual carries:

* the C3h188 linear-Plebanski spatial connection response; and
* the complete C3h188 Lorentz BF-momentum dual response.

The resulting phase readout is definitionally contact-local and
branch-independent.  It does not inspect current support, choose an `e₀|f₁`
or `f₂` branch, generate an M0 event, or claim a global source-time flow.
The opaque wrapper at the end permits a future externally generated,
source-owned provenance value to travel beside the actual without being read
by the physical actualizer.

This closes actual reachability of the Lorentz canonical first jet.  It does
not count constructor substitution as independent stationarity.  Tangent
simplicity and the temporal Lorentz Gauss equation remain downstream,
failure-capable constraints on this same actual family.
-/

namespace
